e-ts\\gaia\\data\\076c8171-9b3b-49b9-a477-244d2a532826.xlsx'); ws=wb.active; [print('|'.join('' if c.value is None else str(c.value) for c in row)) for row in ws.iter_rows()]\"\n   ```\n3. Convert the sheet to `.csv` in Excel/Sheets and drop it in the project — then I can read it with the `read` tool, no shell needed.","toolCallId":"call_f841f089c45746abacb63971","name":"task"}
